  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tend to orate just a bit more clearly when your current subject is a favorite topic.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Topic Favoritism</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The Difficulty Class (DC) of any saving throw called for by the topics present in a haiku subject containing a topic affected by the Topic Favoritism feat is increased by +1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
